OL,3,GNEWSATwo streets to be demolished in
OL,4,Amining subsidence village
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of two streets in a
OL,7,FClackmannanshire village facing mining
OL,8,Fsubsidence have been told their homes
OL,9,Fwill have to be demolished, BBC
OL,10,FScotland has learned.
OL,12,FMeetings were held with residents of
OL,13,FCoalsnaughton on Thursday evening where
OL,14,F97 properties have been evacuated due
OL,15,Fto ground movement.
OL,17,FOfficials from the local council and
OL,18,Fthe Mining Remediation Authority (MRA)
OL,19,Ftold them that 60 houses on two
OL,20,Fstreets, Benbuck View and Dunmoss View,
OL,21,Fwould have to be knocked down.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
